			<p style="text-align:center;">How We Help</p>
			<div class="my-4"></div>
			<h5 style="text-align:center;">Brighten the Holidays</h5>
			<p>The Salvation Army Greater Birmingham Area Command brings Christmas wish lists to life through our Christmas programs.&nbsp; Your continued support is greatly appreciated.</p>
			<div class="py-5"></div>
			<div class="pvlRichtext text-white rounded p-6 gap-3 my-5" style="position:relative;overflow:hidden;min-height:300px;background-image:url("><div class="text-white rounded p-6 gap-3 my-5" style="position:relative;overflow:hidden;min-height:300px;background-image:url('https://s3.amazonaws.com/uss-cache.salvationarmy.org/ba1ae43a-1116-430b-a313-47c06d536cc0_Blue+BG.png');background-position:center center;background-repeat:no-repeat;background-size:cover;">
            <div style="position:absolute;inset:0;z-index:2;"></div>
            <div style="position:relative;z-index:3;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:flex-start;min-height:300px;">
                <div style="width:100%;padding:40px;color:#ffffff;">
                    <div class="btgrid">
	<div class="row row-1">
		<div class="col col-md-6 col-sm-12">
			<div class="content">
				<p style="text-align:center;color:#fff;">
					<img class="img-fluid rounded d-block mx-auto" src="https://s3.amazonaws.com/uss-cache.salvationarmy.org/3fb28876-28f7-4dd1-9bf1-5742f4f94948_9849750a-9302-45c1-b4c7-1790a4013f0a_255019820_5187182337964381_9119289557333576273_n%2B%281%29.jpg">
				</p>
			</div>
